# Decision checklist

Use this stack unless one of these is true:

| Requirement | Better choice |
|---|---|
| App is mostly AR, camera processing, Bluetooth, low-level native APIs | Native Swift/Kotlin or bare React Native |
| You need heavy 3D/game-like UI | Unity, native, or Flutter |
| You need a complex custom backend from day one | NestJS/Fastify + Postgres |
| Team is already deeply Flutter-native | Flutter + Supabase/Firebase |

